void(0);)\n\n[**Bhoomi Airavat**](https://www.magicbricks.com/bhoomi-airavat-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343531303031)\nin [Borivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview#) , Mumbai\n\n[by Bhoomi Group](https://www.magicbricks.com/bhoomi-group-buid-4d423631323931)\n\n Possession in 2031 \n\n5.25 Cr - 10.49 Cr\n\nBhoomi Airavat is an under-construction residential project in Kandivali West by Bhoomi Shashwat Estate Pvt Ltd and has a price range of Rs.5.25 Cr - Rs. 10.49 Cr. The project covers an area of 2 acres and has 4 towers with 460 apartments. The buyers will find 1, 2, 3, and 4 BHK flats with super built-up areas of 489 sq. ft. to 2654 sq. ft available for purchase. The project will be completed by December 2031. Bhoomi Airavat is RERA-approved with the registration number PM1180002600498.\n\n### Bhoomi Airavat: Key Facts\n\n*   Buyers get 4 apartments in 1, 2, 3, and 4 BHK configurations.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat covers an area of roughly 2 acres with 460 residential units.\n\n*   One of the best features is its proximity to Poisar Metro Station at a distance of 0.6 km.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat is still under construction and will be handed over from December 2031.\n\n*   There are eight different sizes of apartments available.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat’s location on Sai Baba Mandir Road in Kandivali West provides easy accessibility to the best schools and shopping complexes.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat is situated at a distance of around 1.8 km from Kandivali Railway Station on the Western Line.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat's amenities include a grand entrance lobby and a rooftop garden. There is also CCTV security and an intercom facility.\n\n### Why Buy Bhoomi Airavat\n\n*   Buyers get to pick from small 1 BHK to large 4 BHK homes.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat is within 10-15 minutes of Link Road, SV Road and Western Express Highway.\n\n*   It offers the convenience of daily commutation as Metro line 2A stations and Kandivali Railway Station are located nearby.\n\n*   The distance to Kalpataru Mall is only 300 metres and makes it easier for you to go shopping and dining.\n\n*   The project is designed to be limited to 460 units across 3 towers to maintain a lower density than that of larger township projects.\n\n*   The multi-layer CCTV monitoring add value for residents who are concerned about safety.\n\n*   The big apartment sizes are ideal for those looking to upgrade.\n\n*   Rooftop garden space offers an outdoor relaxation place.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat has its own play areas for children.\n\n*   The buyers benefit from close proximity to shopping centers for everyday convenience.\n\n### What People Are Saying About Bhoomi Airavat\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat's accessibility by walking to the Metro Line 2A stations has garnered buyers' interest.\n\n*   Many Bhoomi Airavat reviews mention Kandivali West's established residential infrastructure and retail markets.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat’s price sits well with buyers looking for premium, spacious apartments.\n\n*   Buyers mention the easy connectivity to the metro and railway stations.\n\n### Bhoomi Airavat: Location & Connectivity\n\n*   Kandivali Railway Station is located at a distance of about 1.8 km.\n\n*   The Mumbai Metro Line 2A Poisar Metro Station is 0.6 km away from Bhoomi Airavat.\n\n*   The Western Express Highway is approximately 3.5 to 4 km away.\n\n*   Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport is around 17 km away\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat is around 1.8km from V Mall.\n\n*   Sai Baba Mandir Road is near Link Road and SV Road, which are easily accessible by a short drive.\n\n### Amenities Offered in Bhoomi Airavat\n\n*   The rooftop garden gives you ample open space to relax.\n\n*   Bhoomi Airavat has a special kids' area as well.\n\n*   A multi-level security system with CCTV and round-the-clock security guards will take care of your safety.\n\n*   The intercom facility will allow communication between apartments and security guards.\n\n*   Vertical access is planned through passenger lifts within Bhoomi Airavat to improve ease of access.\n\n...read more\n\n*   - [x] Add to Compare \n\nYou can compare only 3 projects at a time\n\n![Image 19: Dotom Vue-Image](https://cdn.staticmb.com/searchstatic/images/blank.png)\n\n9 Photo[s](javascript:void(0);)\n\n2 Floor Plan\n\nVideo\n\n[](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[**RD Aurum**](https://www.magicbricks.com/rd-aurum-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343431353437)\nin [Borivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview#) , Mumbai\n\n Possession in 2028 \n\n(Call for Price)\n\n*   - [x] Add to Compare \n\nYou can compare only 3 projects at a time\n\n![Image 20: Dotom Vue-Image](https://cdn.staticmb.com/searchstatic/images/blank.png)\n\n25 Photo[s](javascript:void(0);)\n\n4 Floor Plan\n\nVideo\n\n[](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[**Solidago The Castle**](https://www.magicbricks.com/solidago-the-castle-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235333739373933)\nin [Borivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview#) , Mumbai\n\n[by Solidago Realty](https://www.magicbricks.com/solidago-realty-buid-4d423838383235)\n\n Possession in 2028 \n\n(Call for Price)\n\nThe Solidago the Castle, positioned on Mount Poisar Road, Borivali West, Mumbai, is a systematic and structured one, equipped with all amenities for a decent lifestyle. It is meticulously kept and occupies a space of 1 Acre. The property has 56 units that are accompanied by a peaceful environment.\n\nThis property's units are currently being constructed. The project encompasses four towers, each of which has been meticulously built. This highly anticipated project began on November 1, 2022. The possession date is August 1, 2027.\n\nThe gorgeous Solidago the Castle has received its commencement certificate. Solidago Realty, a well-known builder, oversaw the entire Solidago the Castle project. Solidago the Castle is ideal for a modern lifestyle, with all facilities and amenities, such as Rain Water Harvesting and Fire Fighting Equipment.\n\nThe site’s address is Mount Poisar Road, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra. The project has the pin code 400092. Solidago the Castle provides a convenient lifestyle that includes all modern conveniences.\n\nKey Facts\n\n*   Location: The postal address of Solidago the Castle is Mount Poisar Road, Borivali west, Mumbai, Maharashtra, 400092\n\n*   Launched: 01 November 2022\n\n*   Possession by: 01 August 2027\n\n*   Project Type: Residential Plots\n\n*   Total Area (Land): 1 Acre\n\n*   No. of Units: 4 Building, 56 plots\n\n*   Plot sizes: 324.00 sq.ft. - 918.00 sq.ft.\n\n*   Developer / Builder:  Solidago Realty\n\n*   RERA ID: P51800047865\n\nLocation Advantages and connectivity\n\n*   Solidago the Castle is about 3 km from the Ovaripada metro station.\n\n*   The Western express highway is about 3 km from the location.\n\n*   Vinayak medico is about 10 minute drive away.\n\n*   Relaxation locations like Gen. Arunkumar Vaidya Ground are 11-15 minutes away from the location.\n\nLandmarks and social infrastructure\n\nSolidago the Castle is surrounded by various schools, colleges, hospitals, and malls, such as:\n\nSchools:\n\n*   St. Francis D'Assisi High School (190m)\n\n*   St. Francis Institute of Management and Research (400m)\n\n*   JBCN International School (650m)\n\nHospital/health care:\n\n*   Bhargav Medical centre (2.8km)\n\n*   Purohit Hospital (2.4km)\n\n*   BMC Hospital (3km)\n\nMalls/Market Places:\n\n*   Moksh Plaza Mall (1.8km)\n\n*   Raghuleela Mega mall (1.9km)\n\n*   Xth centre mall (1.9km)\n\n*   Devraj Mall/Party Hall (1.9km)\n\n*   Ganesh Supermarket (300m)\n\n*   Janta store (1.5km)\n\nHotels/Resorts:\n\n*   Food Adda (200m)\n\n*   The veg treat -2 (200m)\n\n*   90ft above (700m)\n\n*   Spice Republic (800m)\n\nAbout the Developer\n\nThey have come a long way since their Real Estate Company, Chauhan Group, was established in 1985. Today, they are extending their long tradition of creating luxurious living spaces by launching 'SOLIDAGO,' founded by Mr Jayesh Chauhan. Solidago is now primarily involved in property development, redevelopment, investment, and other real estate-related activities.\n\nSolidago Realty Llp is a Limited Liability Partnership formed on July 29, 2022. It is registered with the Mumbai Registrar of Companies. Its total contribution obligation is Rs. 1,000,000.\n\nTotal years of operations: 1 year\n\nPast Epithet: Jayesh Chouhan Group ( since 1985 )\n\nTotal Projects: 11+\n\nCompleted projects: 10+\n\nOn-going projects: 1+\n\nUpcoming projects: 1\n\n## Solidago The Castle Borivali West Mumbai\n\n### Key Facts & USPs\n\n| Feature | Details |\n| --- | --- |\n| Project Key USPs | Largest redevelopment of IC Colony, Sky Lounge with 25+ indulgences, Cineplex, Sports Bar, Mountaineering facilities, Sunrise/Stargazing Observatory, lifetime open view of St. Francis Ground and IC Church |\n| Structure Details | 1 tower with 4 wings, each 13 storeys; Ground + 1 commercial floor, residential floors from 2nd to 13th |\n| Electrical Systems | Includes fire-fighting equipment and rainwater harvesting system |\n| Location Advantages | Strategically located with proximity to schools, hospitals, malls, business centers, and recreational areas; good connectivity via metro and highway |\n\n...read more\n\n*   - [x] Add to Compare \n\nYou can compare only 3 projects at a time\n\n![Image 21: Dotom Vue-Image](https://cdn.staticmb.com/searchstatic/images/blank.png)\n\n11 Photo[s](javascript:void(0);)\n\n5 Floor Plan\n\nVideo\n\n[](javascript:void(0);)\n\n[**Dotom Vue**](https://www.magicbricks.com/dotom-vue-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235343335353231)\nin [Borivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview#) , Mumbai\n\n[by Dotom MV Group](https://www.magicbricks.com/dotom-mv-group-buid-4d423533343330)\n\n Possession in 2028 \n\n(Call for Price)\n\nThe Vue is a 23-storey mid-luxury tower rising on Gorai, Borivali West. With a sleek façade